        "created_at": "2011-08-11T18:41:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This is our first official errata that changes the functionality of a card in the game.</p>\n<p>In Insula Primalis, the card “Enraged T-Rex” has the following text:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>At the end of the Environment turn, this card deals the target with the second highest HP 5 melee damage.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>This is now officially changed to:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>At the end of the Environment turn, this card deals the target other than itself with the second highest HP 5 melee damage.</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:34:36.445Z",
