        "raw": "This is our first official errata that changes the functionality of a card in the game.\n\nIn Insula Primalis, the card \"Enraged T-Rex\" has the following text:\n\n\n> At the end of the Environment turn, this card deals the target with the second highest HP 5 melee damage.\n\n\nThis is now officially changed to:\n\n\n> At the end of the Environment turn, this card deals the target other than itself with the second highest HP 5 melee damage.",
